  "rssi_path_loss_5_2": "BLE 5.2 LE Power Control + Path Loss Monitoring exchange RSSI estimates over LL_POWER_CONTROL_REQ / LL_POWER_CONTROL_RSP / LL_POWER_CHANGE_IND, allowing TX-power adjustment per remote-peer feedback. Path-Loss thresholds (HIGH / MIDDLE / LOW) can be set per zone; controller raises a Path Loss Threshold Event when crossing a zone."
